Subject: backport gemma4 unified multimodal projectors (upstream a731805ced)

Backport of upstream llama.cpp commit a731805ced "mtmd, model: allow
skip build_vit() (#24077)" onto the dbe9c0c pin: adds the encoder-free
gemma4uv (vision, raw 224px/16 patches) and gemma4ua (audio, raw 16 kHz
waveform in 640-sample frames) projector types used by
mmproj-gemma-4-12b-it-qat-q4_0.gguf, plus tokenizer suppress_tokens
support (masks the <image|>/<audio|> tokens via a logits bias, matching
the transformers checkpoint behavior). Conversion-script and CMake
hunks were dropped; the vocab hunks were re-anchored for this pin.

